162	1106,894,1661,1453	162. Complete flower of Trillium.	A Trillium blossom of the size of life, spread open flat: three broad pointed sepals and three shaded petals alternating around the stamens and the pistil in the centre.
163	1153,1549,1647,2027	163. Incomplete flower of Anemony.	An Anemony blossom with a single row of broad, rounded flower-leaves around a crowded centre of many stamens and pistils.
